# workflow-router

Equivalent of `ask-matt` in the original `mattpocock/skills` repo: the router for
every user-reachable skill in this project.

Keep this file updated whenever a user-invoked skill is added, renamed, or removed
(see .claude/CLAUDE.md > Router).

