## How to route

1. Read the person's request.
2. Pick the smallest set of steps that covers it (see `.agents/invocation.md` >
   "Choosing which step to run").
3. Never invoke a user-invoked skill from inside another user-invoked skill; surface
   the next command to the person instead of chaining automatically.
